#: kghostview.cpp:1586
msgid ""
"You chose to print all pages to a file.\n"
"This would produce a document identical to\n"
"that currently loaded into the viewer.\n"
"There is no need to print all pages into a new file."
msgstr ""
"Vos avoz tchwezi do rexhe totes les pådjes dins on fitchî.\n"
"Do côp, vos årîz on documint ki sereut li minme ki\n"
"li ci k' est tcherdjî pol moumint è håyneu.\n"
"Gn a nole avance di rexhe totes les pådjes èn on novea fitchî."

#: kghostview.cpp:1599
msgid ""
"No file name was given so\n"
"nothing could be printed to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vos n' avoz pont dné di no di fitchî, do côp\n"
"dji n' såreu rén rexhe dins on fitchî.\n"

#: kghostview.cpp:1640
msgid ""
"Set Environment variable (to PRINTER or LPDEST for instance)for Printer name "
"to be taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Vos dvoz mete vosse variåve d' inviron'mint (a PRINTER ou LPDEST, metans)po-z avu on "
"no di scrîrece."

